  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "CircuitHunt screens KetGPT-generated parameterized circuits for credit-card fraud detection and selects a 6-qubit, 9-parameter circuit that achieves 97% test accuracy, 0.97 F1, and 0.9946 ROC-AUC on a PennyLane default.qubit simulator. The ablation without the residual skip connection drops to about 70% accuracy/F1 and 0.7706 AUC, showing the skip connection is important for performance, but the paper does not demonstrate practical quantum advantage over classical baselines.",
